\title{TranscriptMetaAnalyst: Graphical Interface for Gene-Level Meta-Analysis of RNA-Seq and Microarray Studies}
\description{
A Shiny application and R package for the gene-level meta-analysis of several bulk RNA-Seq or single-colour microarray studies. Each study is analysed with DESeq2, edgeR, limma-voom or limma, every condition is compared with a reference, and the p-values of the studies are combined with Fisher's or the inverse-normal method. Batch effects can be checked and handled, microarray series can be imported from GEO, and the results are shown as interactive plots and tables, with functional enrichment (PANTHER, KEGG, STRING) and a reproducible R script. It is designed for biologists with little programming experience.
}
